    "title": "Youth Crisis Center debuts new initiative for expecting, young mothers facing homelessness - NewsBreak",
    "text": "1 days ago JACKSONVILLE, Fla. — A new program is hoping to provide aid to young mothers across the First Coast. The Youth Crisis Center (YCC) debuted The MILLS, or the Maternity Independent Living and Life Services program. YCC says they recognized an increasing number of young moms facing homelessness and decided to take action. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 2",
